  "type": "multiple-choice",
  "originalQuery": "You are a Database Engineer who has been tasked with assessing the application and database dependencies of a complex, multi-tier application before migrating it to Google Cloud Platform (GCP). Which of the following steps should be taken to ensure that dependencies are effectively identified?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Analyze the application code, review database schema, and examine SQL queries to identify dependencies between the application and the database.<br/>B. Use Google Cloud Storage to store a copy of the application code and database schema, and then rely on Dataflow for dependency analysis.<br/>C. Migrate the application and database to GCP and then analyze the dependencies using Cloud Logging.<br/>D. Use Cloud Data Fusion to assess the dependencies between the application components and the database.",
  "domain": "Migrate data solutions",
  "hasImage": false,
